sequenceDiagram
    participant N as n8n
    participant S as Sheets
    participant O as OpenProject
    participant H as Custom APIs
    Note over N: Manual start
    N->>S: Read deployment rows
    S-->>N: Return row data
    N->>O: Find work items
    opt Required item is missing
        N->>O: Create work item
    end
    O-->>N: Return task references
    N->>H: Request channel and folder work
    H-->>N: Return helper results
    N->>S: Write selected results
